Recommends: xdg-utils, polkit
Description: Local PHP development environment for Linux
 LinuxDevStackBox manages Apache, MySQL/MariaDB, PHP and phpMyAdmin for
 local PHP development from a single desktop application. Runtimes come
 from the distribution packages; the app generates per-user
 configuration under the XDG directories and runs everything as the
 logged-in user.
 .
 It maps local hostnames in /etc/hosts via a single polkit prompt and
 provides trusted local HTTPS by installing a private CA into the
 system trust store.
